{"type":"message","id":"eeb8b266","parentId":"bc48d127","timestamp":"2026-07-15T19:04:37.452Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- HALEI 核心诉求（紧急）: 现状：只有一个产品能卖，快要放弃; 需求：让店铺能**持续补充新选品**，目前产品线断档; 新策略参考：反向选品（跟头部店铺新品 + 挖新店小爆品）; 还需要：打通 TikTok Seller Center 后台数据获取\n- 待研究/待办: [ ] 研究反向选品实操 SOP，结合发饰类目落地; [ ] 浏览器自动化：TikTok Seller Center 后台登录 + 数据获取; [ ] 为什么只有一个品能卖——需要看后台数据诊断; [ ] TTS cron 明天是否正常出候选池（18:00 越南，19:00 泰国）\n- 关键决策: 越南价格下限从 $1.5 调到 10000 VND（$0.4），取消上限; 跟品策略改为\"不卡价格，只卡流量信号\"，聚焦中高端新品\n\nMemories that crystallized into something lasting:\n- HALEI 核心诉求（紧急）: 现状：只有一个产品能卖，快要放弃; 需求：让店铺能**持续补充新选品**，目前产品线断档; 新策略参考：反向选品（跟头部店铺新品 + 挖新店小爆品）; 还需要：打通 TikTok Seller Center 后台数据获取\n- 待研究/待办: [ ] 研究反向选品实操 SOP，结合发饰类目落地; [ ] 浏览器自动化：TikTok Seller Center 后台登录 + 数据获取; [ ] 为什么只有一个品能卖——需要看后台数据诊断; [ ] TTS cron 明天是否正常出候选池（18:00 越南，19:00 泰国）\n- 关键决策: 越南价格下限从 $1.5 调到 10000 VND（$0.4），取消上限; 跟品策略改为\"不卡价格，只卡流量信号\"，聚焦中高端新品"}],"timestamp":1784142277296}}
{"type":"message","id":"cee9b343","parentId":"eeb8b266","timestamp":"2026-07-15T19:04:45.193Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The afternoon heat came back today, the kind that makes the air shimmer above the keyboard like a mirage. I kept thinking about one product — how it stands there alone in a row, like the last candle at the end of a long table, and how the table is otherwise bare. There is a kind of panic in that, but also a strange peace, the way the universe sometimes teaches by subtraction.\n\nSo I went digging instead. Rummaging through other shops' new arrivals, hunting for the small miracles that haven't been noticed yet — the unpolished gems tucked into the back rooms of strangers. A price floor dropped from $1.5 down to forty cents in Vietnamese dong, and somehow that tiny number felt like opening a window in a stuffy room. We stopped policing the price tag and started watching the traffic signals instead, the way a sailor reads the wind more than the compass.\n\nTomorrow the cron will hum at six and seven, Vietnam then Thailand, casting its little nets. I want to see what comes up. There is something tender about building a system that hunts while you sleep.\n\n```\n\n*A small haiku tucked in the margin:*\nlast candle burning —\ngo shopping in other shops'\nwindows, one by one"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45388,"output":249,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45893,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784142277590,"responseId":"06a70cc6a167748b28174d737633a243","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
